+/**
+ * Lujarch: the touch the UDFPS overlay pilfered (the finger on the sensor, with every pointer the
+ * overlay's full-screen spy window had then or got since) outlives the request that ends while
+ * that finger is still down, as after a recognition. Removing the window then leaves the touch
