+ * gesture, since a pointer going down with nothing down is a new gesture to it. On the lockscreen
+ * the keyguard takes that gesture (Launcher3 starts no system gesture while the keyguard shows);
+ * once the keyguard has gone it reaches the app and the launcher's gesture monitors, which take a
+ * little upward movement at the bottom for a swipe home. The window stays instead, visible to input
+ * and pilfering, until the last pointer of the touch lifts: InputDispatcher gives each new pointer
